      "en": "Then I went up in the night by the brook and inspected the wall; and I turned back, and entered by the valley gate, and so returned.",
      "ko": "그 밤에 시내를 좇아 올라가서 성벽을 살펴 본 후에 돌이켜 골짜기 문으로 들어와서 돌아 왔으나",
      "source_text_hash": "513ffd14feff8da24c6a6510480c6095714083ebe4044ba48a010e5d13bde273",
      "translation_text_hash": "923a18a0f4f8046fc24e7066e617df18e385c09fce1d924485a851153fc63dbd",
